                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "77a253f1-a694-33c1-bde7-b620986f7139",
                        "entry_id": "e862bfa7-3e8d-3109-8de4-4a6fef8a2163",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The realm or sphere of the Turks."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "966a6b70-d245-4a14-970f-33e42bb91550",
                                "sense_id": "77a253f1-a694-33c1-bde7-b620986f7139",
                                "text": "He wears a beard, and he likes his women to be slaves. What man doesn’t? What man would be henpecked, I say? We will cut off all the heads in Christendom or Turkeydom rather than that."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "100b708a-b1f0-4efe-994f-88bb4625ac5f",
                                "sense_id": "77a253f1-a694-33c1-bde7-b620986f7139",
                                "text": "[…] those brilliant alliances which made the young ladies of Circassia the envy of Turkeydom."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e6c17a0b-a546-3142-82ff-d3ffff1c84c9",
                "word": "turkeydom",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4a36493b-d8db-342e-932a-4a4cfdcd86db",
                        "entry_id": "e6c17a0b-a546-3142-82ff-d3ffff1c84c9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The realm or sphere of turkeys (the birds)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a8226a1-6a47-4412-8c7a-cd7ebd210821",
                                "sense_id": "4a36493b-d8db-342e-932a-4a4cfdcd86db",
                                "text": "Then ensued a scene of horror and confusion unequalled in the annals of turkeydom. The gray hen herself, hardly escaping destruction, crept screaming from under the idiot's stomach, and fled with insensate activity, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bf6f9bf-8a10-48fb-be6c-9def64a894be",
                                "sense_id": "4a36493b-d8db-342e-932a-4a4cfdcd86db",
                                "text": "Now let me ease your tender little hearts about my career being so suddenly cut short. I want to tell you that in Turkeydom it is considered a great glory to be the centre of attraction at a Christmas dinner […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67727f9b-935c-4480-a710-691702ef7a69",
                                "sense_id": "4a36493b-d8db-342e-932a-4a4cfdcd86db",
                                "text": "The popular \"fudge\" Holly whose word is pretty nearly law in turkeydom. The bird is a broad-breasted bronze, the new strain he helped to develop."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "03358ac0-9262-4a2a-8228-edeeffd86b88",
                                "sense_id": "4a36493b-d8db-342e-932a-4a4cfdcd86db",
                                "text": "A Win At This Show Is The Highest Honor In Turkeydom"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
